/T (Three Non-Obvious EDA Observations: \(1\) Src_Bytes is heavily right-skewed \(overall mean = 1,431 bytes vs. median = 885 bytes, skewness = 2.71\), driven by heavy-tailed attack payloads. \(2\) While TCP accounts for the largest volume of total traffic \(55%\), ICMP exhibitsthehighest conditional attack rate \(72.1% Attack vs. 44.3% TCP and 15.2% UDP\). \(3\) Flow duration separatessharply by transport state: TCP handshakes/streams average 419.6 ms compared to 187.4 ms for UDP and 68.2msfor ICMP. )
/E (Three Non-Obvious EDA Observations: \(1\) Src_Bytes is heavily right-skewed \(overall mean = 1,431 bytes vs. median = 885 bytes, skewness = 2.71\), driven by heavy-tailed attack payloads. \(2\) While TCP accounts for the largest volume of total traffic \(55%\), ICMP exhibitsthehighest conditional attack rate \(72.1% Attack vs. 44.3% TCP and 15.2% UDP\). \(3\) Flow duration separatessharply by transport state: TCP handshakes/streams average 419.6 ms compared to 187.4 ms for UDP and 68.2msfor ICMP. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
